# Optional. When set, `pnpm run dev` and `pnpm run deploy` copy dist/ into this folder.
# The folder name must equal the plugin ID (unisastra) and its parent `plugins` folder must exist.
# Point it at a test vault, not a working vault.
#
# Example:
# OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PLUGIN_PATH=/absolute/path/to/TestVault/.obsidian/plugins/unisastra
OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PLUGIN_PATH=
